tests must be completed with MACE-matpes-r2scan-omat-ft.model. This file should be put in the data directory. It can be obtained from the mace-mp project

Also the files basis.xyz, control and potentials are required in this directory

Many of the tests (e.g. test_1) run on the GPU by default. The line 'device = "cuda"' can be changed to cpu if a GPU/cuda is not available.

test_1: tests whether some of the libraries are installed correctly - ASE, mace model, janus-core, numpy. It simply reads in basis.xyz using ASE
and calculates an energy.

